name structmech
category Package
revision 58985
shortdesc A TikZ command set for structural mechanics drawings
longdesc This package provides a collection of TikZ commands that allow
longdesc users to draw basic elements in material/structural mechanics.
longdesc It is thus possible to draw member forces, nodal
longdesc forces/displacements, various boundary conditions, internal
longdesc force distributions, etc.
